// The session compositor config: the stock niri session, plus the
// two things kumaOS needs. The background color matches the shell's
// wallpaper base (0x11111B), so the gap between niri.service coming
// up and kuma-shell painting the real wallpaper reads as a fade
// instead of a black flash. The hotkey overlay is noise during
// login handoff, so it never shows.
// Wired in by the image: a niri.service drop-in appends
// `-c /usr/share/kumaos/session-niri.kdl` to ExecStart. See
// docs/session-deploy.md.
layout {
    background-color "#11111B"
}
hotkey-overlay {
    skip-at-startup
}
